元気の呪文 巫女巫女舞舞舞！
The cheer spell: miko miko mai mai mai!

153
00:19:34,436 --> 00:19:36,936
みんな笑顔になあれ！
May everyone be filled with smiles!

154
00:19:37,116 --> 00:19:39,656
にゃっはろー！ みんな楽しめる？
Nyahallo! Can everyone enjoy this?

155
00:19:39,856 --> 00:19:42,636
ここからはスーパーみこみこタイム！
From here on is Super Miko Miko Time!

156
00:19:42,816 --> 00:19:45,636
ぜったいに遅れずにつけてきてね！
Make sure you keep up without falling behind!

157
00:19:45,736 --> 00:19:48,376
