Nekomiko! It's Nekomiko! Let's take a photo!

664
00:54:49,313 --> 00:54:56,313
ねこみこと一緒に記念撮影しよう！ 記念だからね！
Let's take a photo with Nekomiko! Because it's an anniversary!

665
00:54:57,313 --> 00:55:02,703
