だってベビダンス 君に届くまで
'Cause it's a baby dance, until it reaches you,

922
01:15:06,322 --> 01:15:09,542
だってベビダンス 君に会えるまで
'Cause it's a baby dance, until I can meet you,

923
01:15:09,542 --> 01:15:12,212
もっと可愛くなりたいから
Because I want to become even cuter,

924
01:15:12,212 --> 01:15:15,172
どんな時だってそう 頑張れるし
No matter what, I can always do my best,

925
01:15:15,402 --> 01:15:18,222
やだやだ ミスってらんない、ね？
No way, no way, I can't afford to mess up, right?

926
01:15:50,682 --> 01:15:52,632
想像なんてしてなかった現況
A reality I never could have imagined,

927
01:15:52,632 --> 01:15:54,512
君もそう思った?
Did you think so too?

928
01:15:54,512 --> 01:15:57,532
“最高”で止まらないように更新したい
I want to update it so it doesn't stop at "the best".

929
